@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+## ADDED Requirements
+
+### Requirement: Cancelling an order gives back its single-use coupon
+Cancelling an order SHALL release the single-use coupon that order used, so the coupon can be used by another order. A coupon used by a different order SHALL NOT be released.
+
+#### Scenario: Reuse after cancellation
+- **WHEN** an order using a single-use coupon is cancelled and a new order uses the same code
+- **THEN** the new order is accepted with the coupon
+
+#### Scenario: Still used while the order stands
+- **WHEN** an order using a single-use coupon is not cancelled and another order uses the same code
+- **THEN** the second order is refused as already used
